*  does a capture BEHIND a fence commit when the match later FAILS?
        X = '<unset>'
        'ab' ? ('a' . X) FENCE 'z'                      :S(S1)
        OUTPUT = 'match FAILED, X=' X
        :(N1)
S1     OUTPUT = 'match ok, X=' X
N1
*  control: same pattern, match succeeds
        Y = '<unset>'
        'ab' ? ('a' . Y) FENCE 'b'                      :S(S2)F(N2)
S2     OUTPUT = 'match ok, Y=' Y
N2
END
